  "pinLegacyAboutTitle": "Strength and limits",
  "pinLegacyAboutBody": "• At most 9^8 ≈ 43 million walks (about 25 bits) — fewer in practice, because revisits collapse to 0.\n• One-way: there is no decode.\n• Anyone who knows the string and sees one output learns a lot about the mask.\n• Nothing here is saved; the fields are wiped when the app leaves the screen.\n• For new PINs use PIN Shift.",
